{"id":"077d066c160ae693","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation.md","title":"上下文无关文法的最右推导","display":"df-cfg-rightmost-derivation — 上下文无关文法的最右推导","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation","aliases":["73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation"],"display":"df-cfg-rightmost-derivation — 上下文无关文法的最右推导","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.1.4, print pp. 175–177; PDF pp. 197–199","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cfg-rightmost-derivation — 上下文无关文法的最右推导"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.1.4, print pp. 175–177; PDF pp. 197–199"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\)</span>；闭包载集固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\">\\((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}\\beta\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\n[(A,\\gamma)\\in P\\land\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}\\beta\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\n[(A,\\gamma)\\in P\\land\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}\\coloneqq\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^2:\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}\\beta\\},\\qquad\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}^*\\beta\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*}(D_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}\\coloneqq\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^2:\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}\\beta\\},\\qquad\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}^*\\beta\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*}(D_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>右侧 v 全为终结符，确保所替换变量是最右的变量。和最左推导是不同关系，不把未限定的推导次序当成语法树结构差异。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*","display":false},{"tex":"(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}\\beta\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists A\\in V\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\n[(A,\\gamma)\\in P\\land\\alpha=uAv\\land\\beta=u\\gamma v].","display":true},{"tex":"D_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}\\coloneqq\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^2:\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}\\beta\\},\\qquad\n\\alpha\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}^*\\beta\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*}(D_{G,\\mathsf{rm}}).","display":true}],"bytes":1551,"backlinks":[{"id":"c3c84ebd86018553","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-rightmost-derivation|上下文无关文法的最右推导]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["33052f37223a11c6","25902d0bd75ea963"]}